          "message": {
            "text": "eval or exec receives a nonliteral expression. If agent, user, or tool content can reach it, it can execute arbitrary Python. Static analysis does not establish the full data flow. Remediation: Replace dynamic execution with an allowlisted operation dispatcher; use ast.literal_eval only for bounded literal parsing. Isolate unavoidable execution with no ambient credentials and strict resource limits."
          },
